Output docs/demo/runtime-gate.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 260
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type `export PS1='$ ' PATH="$PWD/target/release:$PATH"` Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type `example-agent-runtime-gate`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
